      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — clearer variable names, a descriptive test method name, and a comment explaining the non-obvious behavior being tested.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces the cryptic auto-generated variable name (`jsonIgnoreProperties_Value0`, `boolean0`) with meaningful names (`emptyValue`, `mergeEnabled`), renames the test method to `test_fromNullAnnotation_returnsEmptyValueWithMergeEnabled`, and adds a brief comment explaining the non-obvious contract: that `Value.from(null)` returns the `EMPTY` sentinel whose `merge` flag defaults to `true` to enable proper override layering."
    }
